1
00:00:01,084 --> 00:00:02,919
[siren blaring]

2
00:00:15,056 --> 00:00:16,433
[swallows]

3
00:00:17,809 --> 00:00:19,853
[breathing deeply]

4
00:00:21,354 --> 00:00:22,897
[groans]

5
00:00:23,481 --> 00:00:24,566
[officer 1] Your friend?

6
00:00:25,066 --> 00:00:27,235
Can you explain
what you mentioned earlier?

7
00:00:27,736 --> 00:00:30,780
Well, there's a kid
whose name is Oh Beom-seok.

8
00:00:30,864 --> 00:00:32,824
He goes to Byuksan High School,
over there.

9
00:00:32,907 --> 00:00:36,953
- [officer 1] Oh Beom-seok?
- [Yeong-i] Yes. He called me to a café.

10
00:00:37,037 --> 00:00:39,164
- But he wasn't there by himself.
- Yeong-a.

11
00:00:41,207 --> 00:00:42,751
[gasps] Are you okay?

12
00:00:45,837 --> 00:00:48,548
Are you all right?
Where'd the other students go?

13
00:00:50,884 --> 00:00:52,427
I was the only one there.

14
00:00:53,762 --> 00:00:56,598
- [gasps]
- Listen, it's all right, okay?

15
00:00:56,681 --> 00:00:59,642
You can be honest with us.
You can trust us.

16
00:01:01,478 --> 00:01:03,354
[sighs] I was there alone.

17
00:01:04,105 --> 00:01:05,356
Stop lying.

18
00:01:07,233 --> 00:01:08,193
Don't tell

19
00:01:10,028 --> 00:01:11,905
Su-ho about what happened today.

20
00:01:11,988 --> 00:01:13,156
[Yeong-i gasps] What?

21
00:01:16,618 --> 00:01:17,994
[Su-ho] Hey, Yeon Si-eun.

22
00:01:21,581 --> 00:01:22,791
Hey, Si-eun-a.

23
00:01:25,085 --> 00:01:26,377
[sighs]

24
00:01:44,187 --> 00:01:45,730
[tapping]

25
00:01:48,191 --> 00:01:49,692
[phone buzzing]

26
00:01:55,865 --> 00:01:57,367
[buzzing continues]

27
00:02:08,044 --> 00:02:09,254
[Si-eun] <i>Beom-seok-a.</i>

28
00:02:09,921 --> 00:02:11,756
[poignant music playing]

29
00:02:14,008 --> 00:02:15,135
Yeah?

30
00:02:15,218 --> 00:02:16,928
It's time to stop.

31
00:02:19,597 --> 00:02:21,307
Stop messing with Su-ho.

32
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:28,481
[breathing shakily]

33
00:02:31,025 --> 00:02:32,026
[phone bleeps]

34
00:02:35,655 --> 00:02:37,657
[siren blaring]

35
00:02:40,994 --> 00:02:41,995
[sighs]

36
00:02:47,709 --> 00:02:49,210
[music fades]

37
00:02:50,545 --> 00:02:52,547
["Hero" by Meego playing]

38
00:03:05,852 --> 00:03:10,982
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

39
00:04:03,993 --> 00:04:08,706
DIVIDING NUMBERS WITH TWO AND THREE DIGITS

40
00:04:08,790 --> 00:04:11,042
[Si-eun's father] Honey,
I just asked what you were doing

41
00:04:11,125 --> 00:04:12,543
while he was out getting hurt.

42
00:04:12,627 --> 00:04:13,962
What's wrong with that?

43
00:04:14,045 --> 00:04:16,005
[mother] You're not the only busy one.

44
00:04:16,089 --> 00:04:19,759
Do you think I just relax at home
while you're out training and competing?

45
00:04:20,593 --> 00:04:22,595
You said you wanted to work together.

46
00:04:22,679 --> 00:04:24,597
You said you'd help raise our kid well.

47
00:04:24,681 --> 00:04:26,683
It was your idea to have a kid
in the first place.

48
00:04:26,766 --> 00:04:28,351
I thought it would be easy!

49
00:04:30,561 --> 00:04:31,646
He always gets hurt.

50
00:04:31,729 --> 00:04:34,065
- I thought that he would be a normal kid.
- [mother scoffs]

51
00:04:34,816 --> 00:04:35,942
[sighs]

52
00:04:37,902 --> 00:04:39,028
[sighs]

53
00:04:41,447 --> 00:04:43,491
Uh, uh… Si… Si… Si-eun-a.

54
00:04:44,075 --> 00:04:45,034
Si-eun-a.

55
00:04:45,118 --> 00:04:47,120
[poignant music playing]

56
00:04:48,162 --> 00:04:49,163
Si-eun-a.

57
00:04:49,831 --> 00:04:52,000
Open the door, Si-eun-a. Talk to me.

58
00:04:52,500 --> 00:04:55,336
[mother] Si-eun-a,
will you open the door? Hmm?

59
00:04:56,796 --> 00:04:58,214
- [father] Si-eun-a.
- [knocking]

60
00:04:58,298 --> 00:05:00,800
Open the door, Si-eun-a.
Talk to me, please?

61
00:05:00,883 --> 00:05:01,968
[mother sighs]

62
00:05:02,051 --> 00:05:03,803
- [knocking]
- [father] Yeon Si-eun.

63
00:05:04,804 --> 00:05:07,682
Mom and Dad weren't fighting.
We were just talking.

64
00:05:07,765 --> 00:05:09,726
- Si-eun-a.
- [knocking]

65
00:05:10,685 --> 00:05:12,312
[father] Si-eun-a. Yeon Si-eun.

66
00:05:12,979 --> 00:05:14,022
[mother] Si-eun-a.

67
00:05:16,899 --> 00:05:17,942
[father] Si-eun-a.

68
00:05:20,945 --> 00:05:22,947
[poignant music continues]

69
00:05:27,994 --> 00:05:30,830
[father] It's all right.
Tell me the truth.

70
00:05:30,913 --> 00:05:32,248
[music fades]

71
00:05:32,332 --> 00:05:34,792
Was it the same jerks
who punched your face last time?

72
00:05:34,876 --> 00:05:35,918
[Si-eun sighs]

73
00:05:36,627 --> 00:05:39,464
I'm telling the truth.
I fell down the stairs.

74
00:05:40,548 --> 00:05:42,508
I don't believe that's what happened.

75
00:05:43,509 --> 00:05:44,635
Why were you there?

76
00:05:46,888 --> 00:05:47,930
No reason.

77
00:05:49,182 --> 00:05:50,308
[sighs]

78
00:05:51,559 --> 00:05:53,394
I'm going to transfer you
to another school.

79
00:05:54,437 --> 00:05:55,688
That's all there is to it.

80
00:05:55,772 --> 00:05:57,940
- I don't want to.
- You don't what?

81
00:05:59,150 --> 00:06:00,651
Why are you being like that?

82
00:06:01,444 --> 00:06:03,529
I mean,
it's hard enough raising you by myself.

83
00:06:03,613 --> 00:06:05,281
- Why won't you listen?
- Hey, Dad.

84
00:06:09,243 --> 00:06:10,703
I've been kinda wondering.

85
00:06:12,372 --> 00:06:15,083
How come you're so interested
in my life all of a sudden?

86
00:06:16,751 --> 00:06:17,627
What?

87
00:06:25,343 --> 00:06:26,594
[sighs] Nothing.

88
00:06:27,762 --> 00:06:28,846
[door opens]

89
00:06:32,266 --> 00:06:33,351
[door closes]

90
00:06:33,434 --> 00:06:35,186
[alarm bleeping]

91
00:07:06,509 --> 00:07:08,511
[camera shutters clicking]

92
00:07:09,679 --> 00:07:10,847
[Jin-won laughs]

93
00:07:14,809 --> 00:07:15,810
[phone buzzes]

94
00:07:16,811 --> 00:07:17,645
Yes?

95
00:07:19,939 --> 00:07:21,357
Beom-seok-kun is here at home.

96
00:07:21,441 --> 00:07:22,567
How did it go?

97
00:07:22,650 --> 00:07:24,277
<i>The Seocho Police Station will keep quiet.</i>

98
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:27,155
And for his school,
I've already spoken to the principal.

99
00:07:28,531 --> 00:07:30,032
The madam went to Jeju Island,

100
00:07:30,116 --> 00:07:32,326
so keep an eye on him
and stay by his side.

101
00:07:32,410 --> 00:07:34,328
Who knows what Beom-seok will do next?

102
00:07:37,165 --> 00:07:39,709
He's being sent abroad.
Find him a school in the Philippines.

103
00:07:40,293 --> 00:07:41,127
All right.

104
00:07:41,627 --> 00:07:42,462
[phone bleeps]

105
00:07:44,797 --> 00:07:46,007
[Beom-seok] How did you know?

106
00:07:50,094 --> 00:07:53,431
Aide Park-nim told me
that I would find you in there.

107
00:07:55,224 --> 00:07:56,684
[Beom-seok] About yesterday.

108
00:08:00,438 --> 00:08:01,898
I got a call from the police.

109
00:08:03,357 --> 00:08:04,400
Yeon Si-eun,

110
00:08:05,276 --> 00:08:06,986
he wanted to let this incident go.

111
00:08:07,570 --> 00:08:09,197
He said that he was your friend.

112
00:08:13,618 --> 00:08:16,120
[teacher] What's important
is what they demanded.

113
00:08:16,621 --> 00:08:17,497
In this revolt…

114
00:08:18,873 --> 00:08:20,166
Someone wake him up.

115
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:23,127
- Everyone, stay awake.
- [boy 1] Hey, Su-ho.

116
00:08:23,836 --> 00:08:24,670
Ahn Su-ho.

117
00:08:25,630 --> 00:08:27,215
[teacher] Where did we leave off?

118
00:08:29,300 --> 00:08:31,093
Why is no one answering me?

119
00:08:31,177 --> 00:08:32,428
[Su-ho sighs]

120
00:08:32,512 --> 00:08:34,472
[teacher] The class president should know.

121
00:08:34,555 --> 00:08:36,933
[boy 2] The Japan-Korea Treaty of 1876.

122
00:08:37,016 --> 00:08:39,018
[teacher] All right, then. In that case,

123
00:08:40,394 --> 00:08:42,396
turn to page 109.

124
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,815
Let's learn about the Donghak Uprising.

125
00:08:44,899 --> 00:08:46,567
[tense music playing]

126
00:08:46,651 --> 00:08:48,069
Shall we begin?

127
00:08:48,152 --> 00:08:50,029
To understand the Donghak Uprising,

128
00:08:50,112 --> 00:08:52,698
first we have to learn
about the peasant forces…

129
00:08:52,782 --> 00:08:54,450
[phone buzzing]

130
00:08:57,036 --> 00:08:59,163
AHN SU-HO

131
00:09:05,044 --> 00:09:08,798
SOMETHING CAME UP AT HOME
SO I CAN'T COME TO SCHOOL FOR A WHILE

132
00:09:13,302 --> 00:09:15,096
[Su-ho] Where were you last night? Huh?

133
00:09:15,596 --> 00:09:16,889
You ignored all my calls.

134
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:18,432
What?

135
00:09:20,059 --> 00:09:21,894
[tense music continues]

136
00:09:21,978 --> 00:09:24,230
Are you messing with me
for my birthday still?

137
00:09:24,313 --> 00:09:26,190
Is that what's going on? Huh?

138
00:09:27,567 --> 00:09:29,610
That's enough. It's not funny.

139
00:09:31,821 --> 00:09:33,030
I'm not doing that.

140
00:09:33,948 --> 00:09:35,324
Sorry about yesterday.

141
00:09:40,204 --> 00:09:41,455
[doorbell chiming]

142
00:09:41,539 --> 00:09:43,541
[tense music continues]

143
00:09:48,588 --> 00:09:50,881
[chiming]

144
00:09:57,221 --> 00:09:58,472
[sighs]

145
00:10:08,733 --> 00:10:11,068
{\an8}FINAL EXAM
IN 1 DAY

146
00:10:11,152 --> 00:10:13,070
- [Jeong-chan] Whoa!
- [Tae-hun] What the hell?

147
00:10:13,154 --> 00:10:15,072
- [boy 1] Hey.
- [Jeong-chan] Let's go for a smoke.

148
00:10:15,156 --> 00:10:17,116
- [Tae-hun sighs] Damn it.
- [boy 1] What is that?

149
00:10:17,199 --> 00:10:19,327
- [boy 2] Tell you later.
- [boy 1] Yeah, right.

150
00:10:21,454 --> 00:10:22,747
[Tae-hun] Shit.

151
00:10:24,999 --> 00:10:26,208
[sighs]

152
00:10:28,919 --> 00:10:30,546
Why is Oh Beom-seok absent?

153
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:33,883
No idea.

154
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:36,010
Haven't you called him?

155
00:10:36,844 --> 00:10:38,054
You guys are pretty tight.

156
00:10:39,055 --> 00:10:41,182
His phone's turned off.
You know what's up?

157
00:10:42,141 --> 00:10:44,935
- Tell him he owes me for the damages.
- Yeah, I know.

158
00:10:49,315 --> 00:10:50,483
What?

159
00:10:51,734 --> 00:10:52,610
What damages?

160
00:10:54,612 --> 00:10:55,821
[sighs]

161
00:10:57,865 --> 00:10:59,909
It cost 800,000 won.

162
00:11:01,410 --> 00:11:03,788
If you don't pay me back,
I'll kill you, 'kay?

163
00:11:06,624 --> 00:11:07,667
Answer me.

164
00:11:09,126 --> 00:11:10,169
[Jeong-chan] Okay.

165
00:11:13,339 --> 00:11:14,340
[phone buzzing]

166
00:11:14,423 --> 00:11:18,552
JEONG-CHAN

167
00:11:22,932 --> 00:11:26,352
<i>- Your call cannot be completed as dialed.</i>
- Damn it! Pick up your phone, Beom-seok.

168
00:11:26,435 --> 00:11:29,563
<i>- Please leave a message after the tone.</i>
- Ahn Su-ho needs to be taught a lesson.

169
00:11:29,647 --> 00:11:32,274
[boy 1] Hey, but why
isn't Yeon Si-eun at school?

170
00:11:32,900 --> 00:11:34,318
[boy 2] Did he actually die?

171
00:11:34,985 --> 00:11:38,739
- Yeong-bin was way over the line.
- Hey, what's with all this bullshit?

172
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:42,368
We'd all be attending his funeral
if he was dead, dude.

173
00:11:43,577 --> 00:11:45,746
- Damn it.
- [phone bleeps]

174
00:11:45,830 --> 00:11:47,581
- [ringing tone]
- Ah, man.

175
00:11:54,964 --> 00:11:55,965
[Jeong-chan sighs]

176
00:11:59,468 --> 00:12:00,720
[groans]

177
00:12:02,805 --> 00:12:03,764
[yelps]

178
00:12:05,224 --> 00:12:06,225
[coughs]

179
00:12:06,934 --> 00:12:08,018
[groans]

180
00:12:09,937 --> 00:12:11,230
Wait! Please wait.

181
00:12:12,732 --> 00:12:15,818
Oh Beom-seok called you,
but you wouldn't pick up,

182
00:12:15,901 --> 00:12:18,988
so he brought that girl over
to make you come meet us.

183
00:12:19,905 --> 00:12:20,781
What?

184
00:12:21,282 --> 00:12:24,535
[Jeong-chan] You know,
that girl who lives with you. But

185
00:12:25,619 --> 00:12:28,539
we expected you instead. Not Yeon Si-eun.

186
00:12:28,622 --> 00:12:30,624
[suspenseful music playing]

187
00:12:37,965 --> 00:12:39,467
- And?
- [Jeong-chan] A… and…

188
00:12:39,550 --> 00:12:40,676
Uh, Yeong-bin has this friend

189
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:42,845
who was paid by Oh Beom-seok
to beat you up.

190
00:12:45,347 --> 00:12:47,767
Oh Beom-seok did everything.
None of this was us.

191
00:12:52,938 --> 00:12:53,773
[Jeong-chan yelps]

192
00:13:08,537 --> 00:13:09,830
[Yeong-i] What's going on?

193
00:13:12,124 --> 00:13:13,626
Where is Si-eun hospitalized?

194
00:13:21,717 --> 00:13:23,177
He went home today.

195
00:13:26,013 --> 00:13:27,348
I'm sorry. It's all 'cause of me.

196
00:13:28,974 --> 00:13:30,100
[Yeong-i sighs]

197
00:13:34,313 --> 00:13:35,189
Hey!

198
00:13:42,947 --> 00:13:45,574
Si-eun told me
I had to keep it a secret from you.

199
00:13:48,244 --> 00:13:49,620
Stay out of trouble.

200
00:13:58,546 --> 00:14:00,548
[doorbell chiming]

201
00:14:07,555 --> 00:14:08,639
[Si-eun] Who is it?

202
00:14:10,599 --> 00:14:11,517
[Su-ho] Delivery.

203
00:14:12,017 --> 00:14:13,477
[clock ticking]

204
00:14:16,105 --> 00:14:17,857
Hey, what's up?

205
00:14:18,941 --> 00:14:22,653
[Su-ho] What do you mean, what's up?
I'm thirsty. Give me water.

206
00:14:28,242 --> 00:14:29,827
[lock bleeps]

207
00:14:38,127 --> 00:14:39,169
[chuckles]

208
00:14:40,713 --> 00:14:41,714
You doing all right?

209
00:14:44,884 --> 00:14:46,510
Sure. Yeah.

210
00:14:47,428 --> 00:14:48,470
Why are you here?

211
00:14:48,554 --> 00:14:51,015
I was just in the neighborhood.

212
00:15:05,905 --> 00:15:06,739
Are you okay?

213
00:15:11,076 --> 00:15:12,036
Why?

214
00:15:19,835 --> 00:15:21,921
Tomorrow's finals. Coming to school?

215
00:15:25,049 --> 00:15:25,966
Yeah.

216
00:15:26,800 --> 00:15:27,801
I gotta study.

217
00:15:29,303 --> 00:15:30,721
Okay, good.

218
00:15:32,181 --> 00:15:33,307
See you in class.

219
00:15:35,851 --> 00:15:36,936
[chuckles]

220
00:15:43,776 --> 00:15:45,736
["9" by Han playing]

221
00:15:52,743 --> 00:15:57,748
<i>♪ I'm wearin' out discreetly… ♪</i>

222
00:15:58,707 --> 00:15:59,833
[lock bleeps]

223
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:09,802
<i>♪ It's somewhere I need to go </i>♪

224
00:16:17,351 --> 00:16:22,022
<i>♪ Summer's gone and winter's comin' ♪</i>

225
00:16:28,570 --> 00:16:30,072
[music fades]

226
00:16:32,491 --> 00:16:33,701
[door opens]

227
00:16:37,746 --> 00:16:39,665
- Is he in his room?
- Yes, sir.

228
00:16:42,292 --> 00:16:43,877
You little bastard!

229
00:16:44,628 --> 00:16:46,505
You're nothing but fucking vermin.

230
00:16:46,588 --> 00:16:51,135
[panting] I… told you not to do anything
that shits on my name.

231
00:16:51,802 --> 00:16:52,886
You didn't listen.

232
00:16:52,970 --> 00:16:55,264
- Huh? You little shit!
- [poignant music playing]

233
00:16:55,347 --> 00:16:57,141
What's your goddamn problem?

234
00:16:57,224 --> 00:17:01,186
I told you to do what I say,
barely breathe, and live a quiet life.

235
00:17:01,729 --> 00:17:03,689
You're so pathetic. That was too hard?

236
00:17:03,772 --> 00:17:06,400
Is that too hard? You shit, answer me.

237
00:17:07,067 --> 00:17:07,985
Fucking loser!

238
00:17:08,068 --> 00:17:10,404
You're such a fucking little bitch!

239
00:17:11,405 --> 00:17:13,574
Whew! This fucking little bastard.

240
00:17:14,783 --> 00:17:15,701
You…

241
00:17:16,618 --> 00:17:18,495
Once you go study abroad,

242
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:20,998
you're free to do whatever
the hell you want.

243
00:17:21,081 --> 00:17:22,958
Die from drugs, I don't give a shit.

244
00:17:24,460 --> 00:17:28,589
Just never tell anyone
that you are my son. Understand?

245
00:17:29,590 --> 00:17:30,591
Hey!

246
00:17:31,467 --> 00:17:32,843
Keep an eye on this punk.

247
00:17:33,343 --> 00:17:34,762
[door slams]

248
00:17:37,639 --> 00:17:38,891
[shuddering]

249
00:17:39,641 --> 00:17:41,643
I never asked to be your son.

250
00:17:47,232 --> 00:17:48,233
[music fades]

251
00:17:49,943 --> 00:17:51,570
[insects chirping]

252
00:18:02,247 --> 00:18:03,624
Beom-seok-kun.

253
00:18:03,707 --> 00:18:05,292
Fuck off! Damn it.

254
00:18:06,335 --> 00:18:08,587
Hands off! Don't follow me.

255
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:15,302
[breathing heavily]

256
00:18:16,345 --> 00:18:18,388
- [driver] Where are you headed?
- Just drive, please.

257
00:18:32,402 --> 00:18:33,946
[phone chimes]

258
